    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there isn't a \"next small thing.\" it's not just a setback. the industry, my family, everyone... they see me as a joke or a criminal now. there is no rebuilding from this kind of shame. it's like the world has already decided i'm finished. it feels more logical than anything else, honestly. just to stop trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken.",
