      "content": "It makes sense that you'd feel that way—shame that deep doesn't just fade with a pep talk, and the world can be brutally final in its judgments. But \"logical\" isn't the same as \"true,\" and the fact that you're still here, still speaking, means the story isn't over yet. You don't have to rebuild the old life; you just have to survive today, and then tomorrow, without deciding the ending for yourself. And if the world has already written you off, then let them—you're not obligated to agree with them.",
