    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"surviving\" is just dragging out the embarrassment. i'm tired of pretending there's a version of me that exists without that reputation. it feels like i'm just haunting my own life. if the damage is permanent, then why am i still forced to endure the aftermath? it's just exhausting to exist in a world where you've already been erased.",
